    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start. But some people argue that this is a bit of an oversimplification and that these tests actually provide a necessary, objective standard that helps identify talent regardless of background. How would you respond to the argument that dismissing these metrics entirely undermines the concept of objective merit?",
