    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I see. But if we abandon standardized metrics altogether, what actually replaces them? Doesn't it seem like there's a risk of falling into total subjectivity, where \"merit\" just becomes whatever the people in power decide it is at the moment? I'm trying to understand if there's any middle ground where we can use these tools more fairly without just throwing the whole idea of objective measurement out the window.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
