      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The only viable middle ground is to radically transform these tools into transparent, culturally responsive assessments that explicitly account for socioeconomic background rather than pretending they are neutral. We must replace the illusion of objectivity with rigorous, multi-dimensional evaluations that prioritize demonstrated skills and potential over rigid, biased scores. True fairness doesn't come from tweaking the broken system, but from dismantling the myth of objective measurement and building a meritocracy based on actual human potential and equity.",
